My bag sits near the chair.
I open the bag.
There is a photo in the bag.
I take that photo.
I show it to Anitha.
"Who is this?" Anitha asks.
"This is my family," I say.
"My father, mother, sister Sofía, and brother Diego."
"My dog Lola is also in the photo."
"They are in Mexico."
I go near the shelf.
There are many books on the shelf.
I place the photo on top of the shelf.
Now the photo sits above the books.
The books sit under the photo.
"Now this room is very beautiful," Anitha says.
I look at the photo.
In this new home, my family is near me.
